 is 8 km. to the south.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Peña, Ignacio. “Chinán o el paso del paganismo al cristianismo en Siria.” <title level="m">Liber Annuus</title> 48 (1998): 483–88.
